            "en": "Establishing web automation and scraping on mobile environments is severely hindered by official Playwright and Puppeteer limitations: strict glibc dependencies, mandatory X11/Wayland display servers, and sandboxing constraints make direct Termux execution impossible, while PRoot containerization causes severe resource exhaustion and frequent freezes.",
